cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research-software repository, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "ReBaseGuard: Stopping-Selected Recursive Re-Baselining in Repeated Sequential Monitoring"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Su
    given-names: Jingzhe
    affiliation: "University of Electronic Science and Technology of China"
    email: suzhea0226@gmail.com
abstract: >-
  ReBaseGuard studies recursive selection feedback created when observations
  participating in a sequential alarm are reused to update the next monitoring
  reference. The repository contains analytic theorems, Lean-checked proof
  spines, Arb-certified numerical results, scoped policy evaluations,
  semi-real validation, and a pre-specified negative operational result.
repository-code: "https://github.com/flaggielover/ReBaseGuard"
url: "https://github.com/flaggielover/ReBaseGuard/releases/tag/rebaseguard-sr-gamma-certified"
version: "rebaseguard-sr-gamma-certified"
date-released: 2026-08-27
